{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/563615-are-online-chats-still-a-thing","id":563615,"title":"Are online \"Chats\" still a thing?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-21T18:35:17-07:00","id":563615,"title":"Are online \"Chats\" still a thing?","content":"Back in my day, we'd have these things called &quot;Chats.&quot; You'd go on there, and you'd make a character. Then you'd go in and a ST (who also functioned as a moderator) would nerf everything on it. Finally, they'd &quot;sanction&quot; your sterilized character, and you'd be allowed to go and do social interaction &quot;scenes&quot; with other PCs. Occasionally, an ST would log on and run a big one. In that scene, the chips would fall, and you could finally make the bigger moves you had planning.<br /> <br /> And we liked it that way!<br /> <br /> Anyway, it was supposed to play out like an HBO drama: talk, talk, talk, action, talk, talk, talk, action, etc<br /> <br /> Do they still exist? Do people still make new ones?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2165-macai","name":"Macai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2165_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-21T19:05:34-07:00","id":563632,"title":"","content":"Roll20 is the place to go. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-21T19:11:42-07:00","id":563641,"title":"","content":"The type with a larger playerbase than your average tabletop game, like twenty to a few hundred depending on the popularity of the chat? (Not all of them are on most of the time, of course.) Sounds like a MUSH (or MUX, or whatever MU* codebase you prefer) to me; they usually add a little codebase and different rooms you can go to. I know there are some still dedicated to World of Darkness or Exalted multi-user settings, and not just old and long-running ones but new ones too.<br /> <br /> It was my understanding that Roll20 was more of a place to run smaller, tabletop-style games, with some visual tools, dicerollers and so on to enhance the experience, rather than a persistent environment with people logging on and off here and there. Does Roll20 have big mass playerbase games on it too?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-21T21:43:46-07:00","id":563728,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Macai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/563615-are-online-chats-still-a-thing#post563615\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Back in my day, we'd have these things called &quot;Chats.&quot; You'd go on there, and you'd make a character. Then you'd go in and a ST (who also functioned as a moderator) would nerf everything on it. Finally, they'd &quot;sanction&quot; your sterilized character, and you'd be allowed to go and do social interaction &quot;scenes&quot; with other PCs. Occasionally, an ST would log on and run a big one. In that scene, the chips would fall, and you could finally make the bigger moves you had planning.<br /> <br /> And we liked it that way!<br /> <br /> Anyway, it was supposed to play out like an HBO drama: talk, talk, talk, action, talk, talk, talk, action, etc<br /> <br /> Do they still exist? Do people still make new ones?</div> </div> </div> </div>This sounds exactly like how my old LARP troupe used to run, except online instead of in person. I'd be totally into something like this if I could find one that ran nWoD 2e and was accepting new players.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-21T21:52:15-07:00","id":563729,"title":"","content":"There are still a bunch, but fewer than there used to be.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.sinful-illusions.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sinful Illusions</a><br /> <a href=\"http://www.immortalvigilance.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Immortal Vigilance</a><br /> <a href=\"http://wantonwicked.gamingsandbox.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Wanton Wicked</a><br /> <a href=\"http://tarnishedreflections.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Tarnished Reflections</a><br /> <a href=\"http://unmodchat.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unmod Chat</a><br /> <br /> I'm sure you can find more depending on the search terms you punch into Google.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T10:58:46-07:00","id":564318,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/563615-are-online-chats-still-a-thing?p=563728#post563728\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This sounds exactly like how my old LARP troupe used to run, except online instead of in person. I'd be totally into something like this if I could find one that ran nWoD 2e and was accepting new players.</div> </div> </div> </div>These things were a dime a dozen before. I ran like two or three myself. Got players every time. Unfortunately, the environment was always kind of toxic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2165-macai","name":"Macai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2165_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T11:23:49-07:00","id":564347,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/563615-are-online-chats-still-a-thing?p=563729#post563729\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://www.sinful-illusions.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sinful Illusions</a><br /> <a href=\"http://www.immortalvigilance.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Immortal Vigilance</a><br /> <a href=\"http://wantonwicked.gamingsandbox.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Wanton Wicked</a><br /> <a href=\"http://tarnishedreflections.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Tarnished Reflections</a><br /> <a href=\"http://unmodchat.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Unmod Chat</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Heh, I like how many of those sound like titles to mid-nineties Skinemax &quot;thrillers.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T16:06:20-07:00","id":564679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Macai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/563615-are-online-chats-still-a-thing?p=564318#post564318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">These things were a dime a dozen before. I ran like two or three myself. Got players every time. Unfortunately, the environment was always kind of toxic.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that was my experience with LARP as well. Especially with vampire games. Something about a large group of people who primarily interact with each other by pretending to be a bunch of manipulative backstabbing parasites seems to bring out the worst in everyone involved <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-26T11:17:46-07:00","id":569425,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/563615-are-online-chats-still-a-thing?p=564679#post564679\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, that was my experience with LARP as well. Especially with vampire games. Something about a large group of people who primarily interact with each other by pretending to be a bunch of manipulative backstabbing parasites seems to bring out the worst in everyone involved <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.</div> </div> </div> </div>And these chats always had the same people moving between them. Here's how it went with me every time: I'd start a chat, everyone would like how I ST things. They'd figure out that I'm me. Suddenly everything is shit.<br /> <br /> And my crimes against the community usually involve my sense of humor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2165-macai","name":"Macai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2165_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"76"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-26T12:07:50-07:00","id":569478,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Macai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/563615-are-online-chats-still-a-thing?p=569425#post569425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And these chats always had the same people moving between them. Here's how it went with me every time: I'd start a chat, everyone would like how I ST things. They'd figure out that I'm me. Suddenly everything is shit.<br /> <br /> And my crimes against the community usually involve my sense of humor.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Trust me, I feel your pain. The community was very incestuous and cliquish. Also, most of the people I knew had to play Rank 7 Garou or 4th generation Kindred or any number of powerful things. <br /> A new room would open up on a site. Everyone flocked there. Then, the boredom kicked in and they left and the room would stay up. Thus creating a useless room. The room would stay up, and then there are 423 rooms that no one goes to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}